WEBVTT


00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.240
I've been living here for twenty-seven days

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:03.440
inside a Chevette.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.800
The problem is that the money is coming in and

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.560
Chevette is listening

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:18.800
I had to cancel the gym.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.400
let's say I had some technical problems

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.840
in life you have to learn.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.120
if you don't have a dog,

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:28.600
starts hunting with cat.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.880
It's been a few days since my back pain returned.

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:49.320
I took the bench here

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.400
to make a space to transport a dog

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:53.400
and it didn't work.

00:00:53.401 --> 00:00:55.321
now I'm out of business,

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.240
without a bench and without a bed.

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.200
and then chevas went wrong.

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:20.800
I promised truffle to a customer,

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.040
I said I was going to stop by.

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.360
the chevas gave trouble.

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:27.360
now i'm here at the barbershop,

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.360
I will deliver flyer,

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:33.400
but OR do you accept this situation

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.425
OR do you do something different to change it. 

00:01:36.425 --> 00:01:36.680
Man,

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:41.477
won't believe the message I got. 

00:01:41.477 --> 00:01:42.120
big deal,

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.246
I got an invitation from the Cocoa Show, 

00:01:45.246 --> 00:01:45.560
brother,

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.841
I got an invitation from the Cocoa Show. 

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:48.240
brother,

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:50.960
I received an invitation from the Cocoa Show

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:00.760
here huh?

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.400
our bro,

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.280
our bro,

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:08.560
he goes making 1 funnel.

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:08.910
bro, 

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:09.822
you have to be smaller, 

00:02:09.822 --> 00:02:11.040
do you have more wood like this?

00:02:11.041 --> 00:02:11.841
I don't.

